{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_2026_08_28_openai_realtime_mcp_tools", "label": "OpenAI Realtime MCP Tools", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md"}, {"id": "concept_owner_id_null_mcp_writes", "label": "Consequence: MCP writes are anonymous, owner_id NULL", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "rationale": "The shared static MCP token authenticates a caller, not a person, so a word saved via MCP has owner_id NULL; safe with one learner, becomes cross-learner leakage with a second learner."}, {"id": "concept_openai_mcp_require_approval_never", "label": "require_approval:\"never\" is load-bearing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "rationale": "Default \"always\" makes the model wait for an mcp_approval_response the mobile transport never sends, producing a silent hang rather than an error."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_2026_08_28_openai_realtime_mcp_tools", "target": "concept_openai_mcp_require_approval_never", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.9, "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_2026_08_28_openai_realtime_mcp_tools", "target": "concept_owner_id_null_mcp_writes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.9, "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_2026_08_28_openai_realtime_mcp_tools", "target": "docs_2026_08_23_mcp_server_add_words", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "weight": 0.8}, {"source": "docs_2026_08_28_openai_realtime_mcp_tools", "target": "docs_2026_08_27_mcp_static_token_auth", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/2026-08-28-openai-realtime-mcp-tools.md", "weight": 0.